type: software
title: "PathForge: Learn → Build → Prove"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Flask platform that assesses a learner's level with short
  knowledge checks and generates personalised, evidence-based start guides
  across 16 career paths, using curated free resources with an inspectable
  verification record.
